{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06410","headline":"杂兴 · 李颀","name":"杂兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈沈牛渚矶，旧说多灵怪。\n行人夜秉生犀烛，洞照洪深辟滂湃。\n乘车驾马往复旋，赤绂朱冠何伟然。\n波惊海若潜幽石，龙抱胡髯卧黑泉。\n水滨丈人曾有语，物或恶之当害汝。\n武昌妖梦果爲灾，百代英威埋鬼府。\n青青兰艾本殊香，察见泉鱼固不祥。\n济水自清河自浊，周公大圣接舆狂。\n千年魑魅逢华表，九日茱萸作佩囊。\n善恶死生齐一贯，祗应斗酒任苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}